    skos:narrower <https://data.niod.nl/WO2_Thesaurus/10686>, <https://data.niod.nl/WO2_Thesaurus/events/10846>,
      <https://data.niod.nl/WO2_Thesaurus/20541>, <https://data.niod.nl/WO2_Thesaurus/20542>,
