  <https://data.niod.nl/WO2_Thesaurus/corporaties/4754> a skos:Concept, <http://www.w3.org/2003/01/geo/wgs84_pos#SpatialThing>;
    dcterms:contributor <https://digitaalerfgoed.poolparty.biz/user/helfricha>;
