    <https://data.niod.nl/thesaurus_wo2/ImagesWW2/hasHighlightedObjects> <https://www.collectiegelderland.nl/flipjeenstreekmuseumtiel/object/96a57f3d-1e55-4271-36da-0e220a0543c8>,
