    <https://data.niod.nl/thesaurus_wo2/ImagesWW2/sourceImage> "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File:De_voormalige_Jodensavanna_aan_de_Surinamerivier_in_Suriname,_Bestanddeelnr_252-6453.jpg&oldid=511082702";
