    <https://data.niod.nl/thesaurus_wo2/ImagesWW2/imageURL> "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Alex_Moroder_Max_Stuflesser_Ernst_Prinoth_Prisoners_of_war_Stalag_XVIII-A_Wolfsberg.jpg/1920px-Alex_Moroder_Max_Stuflesser_Ernst_Prinoth_Prisoners_of_war_Stalag_XVIII-A_Wolfsberg.jpg";
