      "http://www.japanseburgerkampen.nl/Soember%20Gesing.htm"@nl, "https://www.indischekamparchieven.nl/nl/zoeken?mivast=963&mizig=276&miadt=963&miaet=14&micode=kampen&minr=1396963&milang=nl&misort=unittitle%7Casc&mizk_alle=Dampit&miview=ika2"@nl;
